        "body": "Agency buyers are not reported. Elbit Systems of America Night Vision obligated $323M in FY2026 to date, which reflects 113 awards and an average award size of $2.9M. Historical obligations rose from $31.5M in FY21 to $323M in FY26, which shows concentrated activity but no agency breakdown is available."
      },
      {
        "heading": "What products and markets drive Elbit Systems of America Night Vision obligations?",
        "body": "Commercial and Service Industry Machinery Manufacturing drives obligations at $294M in FY2026 to date. Search, Detection, Navigation, Guidance, Aeronautical, and Nautical System and Instrument Manufacturing accounts for $24M, and Manufacturing and Reproducing Magnetic and Optical Media accounts for $2.6M, with smaller contributions across Hardware Manufacturing and several electronic and audio/video manufacturing NAICS."
